      "en": "I turned around, and my heart sought to know and to search out, and to seek wisdom and the scheme of things, and to know that wickedness is stupidity, and that foolishness is madness.",
      "ko": "내가 돌이켜 전심으로 지혜와 명철을 살피고 궁구하여 악한 것이 어리석은 것이요 어리석은 것이 미친 것인줄을 알고자 하였더니",
      "source_text_hash": "3f414448057c463edca31345ae27bde1c764cf91d53fc56f0e1a60bb85996a6d",
      "translation_text_hash": "978188969df0aee9199230195e7863230f2278161c6884960cb53e26bdce2ade",
